function StartDedicated{if(DebugReady){return};foreach($p in @(DedicatedProcs)){try{Stop-Process -Id ([int]$p.ProcessId) -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue}catch{}};Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 700;$chrome=FindChrome;$args=@("--remote-debugging-port=$Port",'--remote-allow-origins=*',"--user-data-dir=$UserData",'--profile-directory=Default',"--load-extension=$ExtensionRoot",'--new-window','--no-first-run','--no-default-browser-check','--disable-session-crashed-bubble',$TargetUrl);Start-Process -FilePath $chrome -ArgumentList $args|Out-Null;$d=(Get-Date).AddSeconds(25);do{Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 400;if(DebugReady){return}}while((Get-Date)-lt$d);throw 'CDP_PORT_NOT_READY'}
